WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. Southern Cross Station is the second busiest railway station in Melbourne, with more than nine million passenger movements recorded between 2007 and 2008. As well as being served by the city's suburban train services, Southern Cross is the terminus for the State of Victoria's Regional Rail Network.
我们的节目涉及严重且往往令人痛心的事件。如果您在任何时候觉得需要支持，请联系您当地的危机中心。有关保密支持的建议电话号码，请查看您使用的应用程序或我们网站上的本集节目简介。南十字车站是墨尔本第二繁忙的火车站，2007年至2008年间记录的旅客吞吐量超过九百万人次。除了该市的市郊列车服务外，南十字车站还是维多利亚州区域铁路网的终点站。

2
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:36.000
A shopping complex adjoins the station, and underneath is a coach terminal providing buses to interstate and regional destinations, as well as the Skybus shuttle service that travels to Melbourne's Tullamareen Airport. For security purposes, a number of closed-circuit television cameras are placed at strategic locations throughout. On Saturday, September 15, 2007, just after 10am, an elderly Chinese couple were walking through Southern Cross Station when they noticed a female toddler standing alone near the escalator.
车站旁连接着一个购物综合体，地下是一个长途汽车客运站，提供前往州际和区域目的地的巴士，以及开往墨尔本图拉马林机场的天空巴士穿梭服务。出于安全考虑，多处战略位置都安装了闭路电视摄像头。2007年9月15日星期六上午10点刚过，一对年迈的中国夫妇正走过南十字车站，这时他们注意到一个女幼儿独自站在自动扶梯旁。

3
00:01:36.000 --> 00:02:17.000
She was of Asian appearance and looked to be around three years old. She had short dark hair cut in a bob and wore a red denim hooded jacket, an aqua-coloured vest with a red and pink diamond pattern, and bright pink corduroy pants. Thinking the toddler might have been lost, the couple approached and attempted to speak to her. When she didn't respond, they beckoned a Victoria Rail employee named Marino Michuglu over to see if he could help. While trying to speak with the child, Marino patted her on the head and immediately noticed
她有着亚洲人的外貌，看起来大约三岁。她留着短短的波波头短红色深色发，穿着一件红色牛仔连帽夹克、一件带有红粉相间菱形图案的水蓝色背心，以及一条亮粉色灯芯绒裤子。这对夫妇以为这个幼儿可能走失了，便走上前去试图跟她说话。见她没有反应，他们招手叫来了一名名叫马里诺·米舒格卢的维多利亚铁路员工，看看他能否帮忙。在试图与孩子交谈时，马里诺轻轻拍了拍她的头，并立即注意到

4
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:56.000
that her hair was very greasy as though it hadn't been washed in some time. There was no sign of any frantic parents looking for their lost child, so Marino decided to summon police to the scene. Responding officers also attempted to communicate with the child, but she was either unwilling or unable to tell them her name. Knowing that the vest she was wearing was made by a popular children's clothing brand called Pumpkin Patch, they decided to nickname her Pumpkin until a proper identification could be made.
她的头发非常油腻，就像很久没洗过一样。现场没有看到任何惊慌失措的父母在寻找他们走失的孩子，于是马里诺决定叫警察到现场。出警的警员也试图与孩子沟通，但她要么不愿、要么无法告诉他们自己的名字。由于知道她身上穿的背心是由一个名为“南瓜田”的知名童装品牌制造的，他们决定给她起个昵称叫“南瓜”，直到确认真实身份为止。

5
00:02:56.000 --> 00:04:03.000
The girl's clothing provided no real clue to her identity, as although the Pumpkin Patch brand was based in New Zealand, it was sold widely throughout Australia. On her unwashed hair, Pumpkin appeared to be a healthy, well cared for child who was appropriately dressed in clean clothing. The police took her into their care, hoping she was merely lost and her parents would soon come forward to claim her. When no one did, they scoured CCTV footage from Southern Cross Station and quickly realized that Pumpkin had been deliberately abandoned.
女孩的衣服并没有为她的身份提供真正的线索，因为尽管“南瓜田”品牌总部设在新西兰，但它在澳大利亚各地广泛销售。除了她那没洗过的头发外，“南瓜”看起来是一个健康、照顾得很好的孩子，穿着干净得体的衣服。警方将她接走照顾，希望她只是迷路了，她的父母很快就会来认领她。当没有人来时，他们搜查了南十字车站的闭路电视监控录像，很快意识到“南瓜”是被蓄意遗弃的。

6
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:50.000
At 10am on Saturday, September 15, 2007, the Southern Cross security cameras had captured Pumpkin as she walked through the station's street level lobby, hand in hand with a middle-aged, dark-haired man of Asian appearance. The man was dressed in black trousers and a grey suit jacket, and was pulling a small suitcase on wheels in his left hand. When the pair reached the base of an escalator that led to the upper floor, the man seemingly instructed Pumpkin to remain where she was, before stepping onto the escalator alone. Upon reaching the first floor, he glanced back briefly, then continued striding purposefully
2007年9月15日星期六上午10点，南十字车站的安全摄像头拍下了“南瓜”穿过车站街层大厅的画面，她手拉着一个中年、黑发、亚洲面孔的男子。这名男子穿着黑色裤子和灰色西装外套，左手拉着一个小轮式行李箱。当两人走到通往二楼的自动扶梯底部时，这名男子似乎指示“南瓜”留在原地，然后独自踏上了自动扶梯。到达二楼后，他简短地回头看了一眼，然后继续坚定地大步向前。

7
00:04:50.000 --> 00:05:29.000
ahead. The young child remained standing all by herself at the base of the escalator, barely moving, as though she was trying her best to stay still. After viewing the footage, multilingual staff from Victoria Police attempted to converse with Pumpkin, and a number of different interpreters were summoned, but none succeeded in communicating with her. The following day of Sunday, September 16, the Department of Human Services arranged for Pumpkin to be placed with an emergency foster family.
小女孩独自一人站在自动扶梯底部，几乎一动不动，好像在竭尽全力保持静止。观看监控录像后，维多利亚州警察局的多语种工作人员试图与“南瓜”交谈，并请来了几位不同的口译员，但都没有成功与她沟通。第二天，即9月16日星期日，人类服务部安排将“南瓜”寄养在一个紧急寄养家庭。

8
00:05:29.000 --> 00:06:17.000
That same day, the police shared the CCTV footage as part of a public appeal for the girl's parents, extended family members, or anyone who recognized her to come forward. They reported that although Pumpkin had been through a considerable ordeal and wasn't speaking to anybody, she had appeared happy and perky overnight. Media outlets soon started sharing Pumpkin's story in an effort to discover who she was and why she had been separated from her family. Members of the public immediately began contacting Victoria Police to say that they recognized the pair, with a number of calls coming from the neighboring country of New Zealand.
当天，警方分享了闭路电视监控录像，作为公众呼吁的一部分，寻找女孩的父母、其他家庭成员或任何认得她的人站出来。他们报告说，“南瓜”虽然经历了一番折磨，不跟任何人说话，但过了一夜后显得开心而有精神。各大媒体很快开始传播“南瓜”的故事，试图查明她是谁以及她为什么与家人分离。公众成员立即开始联系维多利亚州警方，称他们认出了这两人，其中有几个电话来自邻国新西兰。

9
00:06:17.000 --> 00:07:02.000
The callers believed the man captured on camera was Nguyen Xue, a 53-year-old martial arts instructor and prominent member of the Chinese community from Auckland, New Zealand. The girl he had abandoned was believed to be his three-year-old daughter, Chen Xun Xue. One individual reported seeing the father and daughter while on board a flight from Auckland to Melbourne several days earlier, on Thursday, September 13. They obtained the flight's passenger manifest and examined the list of individuals who had been on board. Based on this information, they confirmed that Pumpkin was in fact Chen Xun Xue and
打电话的人认为监控器里拍到的男子是阮雪（音译，Nguyen Xue），他是一名53岁的武术教练，也是新西兰奥克兰华人社区的知名成员。他遗弃的女孩被认为是他的三岁女儿陈勋雪（音译，Chen Xun Xue）。一位目击者报告说，几天前的9月13日星期四，在从奥克兰飞往墨尔本的航班上看到了这对父女。他们获取了该航班的乘客名单，并检查了机上人员名单。根据这些信息，他们确认“南瓜”实际上就是陈勋雪，而

10
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:45.000
the man was her father, Nguyen Xue. Further inquiries revealed that upon landing in Melbourne, Xue had told custom agents that he and his daughter were visiting the city for a holiday. However, later that evening when they checked in at a hotel, Xue told the hotel's porter that he was permanently relocating to Melbourne. He had even inquired about the best area to live and where to purchase a car. The following morning of Friday, September 14, Xue had visited a travel agency in Melbourne's Central Business District and attempted to book a flight to the US city of Los Angeles
那名男子是她的父亲阮雪。进一步调查显示，阮雪在墨尔本降落后，曾告诉海关人员，他和女儿是来该市度假的。然而，当天傍晚晚些时候，当他们在酒店登记入住时，阮雪告诉酒店门童，他将永久搬迁到墨尔本。他甚至打听了哪个区域最适合居住以及在哪里买车。第二天，即9月14日星期五，阮雪参观了墨尔本中央商务区的一家旅行社，并试图预订当天傍晚飞往美国洛杉矶的航班。

11
00:07:45.000 --> 00:08:25.000
that evening. When the travel agent informed him there weren't any direct flights available, Xue queried about connecting flights from other locations before settling on a direct flight from Melbourne to Los Angeles scheduled for the following day. Approximately 24 hours later, he abandoned Chen Xun at Southern Cross Station and made his way to Melbourne Airport. There, after he successfully passed through a security checkpoint, CCTV cameras caught him smiling widely and flashing two thumbs up.
当旅行社告知他没有直飞航班时，阮雪询问了来自其他地点的转机航班，最后决定预订第二天从墨尔本直飞洛杉矶的航班。大约24小时后，他在南十字车站遗弃了陈勋，并前往墨尔本机场。在那里，在成功通过安检后，闭路电视摄像头拍到他开怀大笑并竖起了两个大拇指。

12
00:08:25.000 --> 00:09:10.000
By the end of Sunday, September 16, police had solved the mystery of Chen Xun's identity, but two new questions had sprung up in its place. They now had to figure out why Nguyen Xue had left his daughter alone at a busy railway station and the whereabouts of his wife and Chen Xun's mother, 28-year-old Anen Liao. Based on the evidence uncovered so far, there was no indication she had travelled to Melbourne with her family. Anen Liao was born on February 20, 1979 in Chauncha, the capital city of China's Hunan province.
到9月16日星期日结束时，警方解开了陈勋身份之谜，但随之涌现出了两个新问题。他们现在必须弄清楚为什么阮雪要把女儿独自留在繁忙的火车站，以及他的妻子兼陈勋的母亲、28岁的安恩廖（音译，Anen Liao）的下落。根据迄今为止发现的证据，没有任何迹象表明她曾与家人一起去过墨尔本。安恩廖于1979年2月20日出生在中国湖南省省会长沙。

13
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:56.000
She was the only child to prosperous parents and grew up to have a range of interests, including reading, listening to music, singing karaoke, and watching films. Her all-time favourite movie was Chinese Odyssey, a 1995 two-part feature based on a classic 16th century novel set during the Ming dynasty. As well as having an interest in pop culture, Anen was an active person who played badminton and enjoyed going out driving. Having lived her entire life in a bustling, popular city, Anen often dreamed of visiting an idyllic island or forest and also hoped to move overseas one day.
她是富裕家庭的独生女，长大后有着广泛的兴趣，包括阅读、听音乐、唱卡拉OK和看电影。她有史以来最喜欢的电影是1995年的两部分别取材于明代经典16世纪小说的电影《大话西游》。除了对流行文化感兴趣外，安恩是一个活跃的人，她打羽毛球，喜欢开车外出。安恩一生都在一个繁华、受欢迎的城市生活，她经常梦想去一个田园诗般的岛屿或森林，也希望有一天能移居海外。

14
00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:41.000
In April 2002, at the age of 23, she achieved both goals by moving to New Zealand, a small island country renowned for its striking natural beauty. Anen had applied for a student visa to study English and she set herself up in the city of Auckland on the country's North Island. At the time, Auckland was home to a rapidly growing Chinese community, but its insularity and disconnection from New Zealand's broader population meant that many new arrivals battled with feelings of isolation. People like Anen, who had difficulty speaking English, struggled even more.
2002年4月，23岁的她通过移居新西兰实现了这两个目标，这是一个以迷人自然风光而闻名的小岛国。安恩申请了学生签证去学习英语，并在该国北岛的奥克兰市安顿下来。当时，奥克兰是迅速增长的华人社区的家园，但其孤立性以及与新西兰更广泛人口的脱节，意味着许多新来者都在与孤立感作斗争。像安恩这样英语说得不好的人，挣扎得更加厉害。

15
00:10:41.000 --> 00:11:26.000
Although she was happy to be in New Zealand, Anen often felt lonely in her new home. She initially moved in with another woman, but in early 2003, she began renting a room at the home of Nain Shwey, who was aged in his late 40s at the time. Shwey was born in 1954 in the city of Te Ling in northeast China. During early adulthood, he worked as a middle school physical education teacher and lived for a time in Los Angeles. He eventually returned to China where he married his first wife and in 1981, the two had a daughter they named Grace.
尽管很高兴能来到新西兰，但安恩在新家经常感到孤独。她最初与另一个女人合住，但在2003年初，她开始在南·施韦（音译，Nain Shwey）的家中租一个房间，当时他已经快五十岁了。施韦于1954年出生在中国东北的铁岭市。在青年时期，他曾担任中学体育教师，并在洛杉矶生活过一段时间。他最终回到中国，在那里与他的第一任妻子结婚，并在1981年生下了一个女儿，他们给女儿起名叫格蕾丝（Grace）。

16
00:11:26.000 --> 00:12:10.000
10 years later, Shwey immigrated to New Zealand alone, leaving his family behind. Shwey had a passion for martial arts and was convinced that it was his destiny to share his unique blend of kung fu and tai chi with others around the world. After moving to Auckland, Shwey began holding martial arts classes in a Chinese restaurant, where he predominantly taught Wu style tai chi. His program was a success and he soon upgraded to a larger venue in Auckland's central business district, before eventually relocating his school to a sprawling parkland in the inner city suburb of Epsom.
10年以后，施韦独自一人移民新西兰，将家人抛在脑后。施韦对武术有着极大的热情，并坚信将自己独特的功夫与太极融合分享给世界各地的人是他的宿命。搬到奥克兰后，施韦开始在一个中餐馆举办武术班，他主要在那里教授吴式太极拳。他的计划取得了成功，他很快升级到奥克兰中央商务区的一个更大场地，最后将他的学校搬到了内城埃普索姆（Epsom）郊区的一个广阔公园。

17
00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:54.000
He told his students he had learned his martial arts skills from a man with a long white beard whom he had encountered when playing in the mountains as a child. The fairytale-like story was eventually published in local Chinese-language newspapers, drawing more students and increasing Shwey's business. Within a few years of arriving in New Zealand, Shwey obtained citizenship and became something of a local celebrity in Auckland's Chinese community. In 1998, he further enhanced his own mythos by self-publishing an autobiography titled The Pearl of Wu Style Tai Chi.
他告诉学生，他的武术技能是一位留着长白胡子的老人传授给他的，那是他在童年时在山上游玩时偶然遇到的。这个童话般的故事最终发表在当地的中文报纸上，吸引了更多的学生，并增加了施韦的生意。来到新西兰几年后，施韦获得了公民身份，并在奥克兰的华人社区成了某种当地名人。1998年，他通过自费出版一本名为《吴式太极拳之珍珠》的自传，进一步提升了自己的神话色彩。

18
00:12:54.000 --> 00:13:41.000
In the book, Shwey claimed to have been conceived by magic. Before he was born, his aging, childless mother allegedly went to a temple to pray for a son. While there, she had a vision in which an elderly man told her she would have a baby boy who would grow up to be a great and successful man. Shortly afterwards, she became pregnant. In early 2003, Shwey took Annen into his home as a border on the condition that she cleaned the house in exchange for her room. Shortly into this arrangement, Annen confided that her student visa was due to expire.
在这本书中，施韦声称自己是通过魔法受孕的。在他出生之前，他年迈且没有孩子的母亲据称去了一座寺庙祈求生个儿子。在那里，她有了一个异象，一位老头告诉她，她会生下一个男孩，长大后将成为一个伟大而成功的人。不久之后，她怀孕了。2003年初，施韦将安恩作为寄宿生接到家中，条件是她打扫房子以换取房间。在这种安排刚开始不久，安恩吐露说她的学生签证即将到期。

19
00:13:41.000 --> 00:14:22.000
She wanted to stay in New Zealand but couldn't afford the tuition fees required to continue studying and therefore wouldn't be able to renew her visa. Shwey was aware that marrying a New Zealand citizen would be an alternative way for Annen to remain in the country and suddenly proposed to her in a roundabout fashion by asking, What about me? Even though there was a 25-year age difference between the two, Annen felt she didn't have any other options if she wanted to stay in New Zealand. She agreed to marry Shwey, believing that his many accomplishments and high standing
她想留在新西兰，但承担不起继续学习所需的学费，因此无法续签签证。施韦知道与新西兰公民结婚是安恩留在该国的另一种方式，于是他拐弯抹角地向她求婚，问道：“我怎么样？”尽管两人之间有25岁的年龄差距，但安恩觉得如果她想留在新西兰，自己别无选择。她同意嫁给施韦，认为他的许多成就和在社区中的崇高地位是她丈夫应有的品质。两人开始了一段恋爱关系，并于2003年7月28日在奥克兰婚姻登记处结婚。

20
00:14:22.000 --> 00:15:10.000
in the community were worthy qualities in her husband. The pair began a romantic relationship and on July 28, 2003, they were married at an Auckland registry office. On the day of their wedding, Annen was already four months pregnant with their first child. In September 2003, Annen applied for New Zealand residency. Three months later, on December 22, she gave birth to Chen Shun. Shwey was reportedly disappointed that the baby wasn't a boy but Annen adored her and the mother and daughter became inseparable.
在他们结婚那天，安恩已经怀有他们第一个孩子四个月了。2003年9月，安恩申请了新西兰居留权。三个月后的12月22日，她生下了陈顺。据报道，施韦对生下的不是个男孩感到失望，但安恩对她疼爱有加，母女俩形影不离。

21
00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:54.000
To those who knew Annen, it made no sense that she would stay in New Zealand while her husband took their daughter to a foreign country. On Monday, September 17, 2007, the day after Victoria police confirmed Chen Shun's identity, she finally spoke her first words to authorities by asking for her mother. Victoria police had been in touch with their counterparts in Auckland who said about trying to contact Annen Leal. Her mobile phone was switched off so they headed to the family's residence, a white weatherboard house on Keystone Avenue in the southwestern suburb of Mount Roscoe.
对于认识安恩的人来说，她留在新西兰而丈夫带着女儿去外国是毫无道理的。2007年9月17日星期一，即维多利亚州警方确认陈顺身份的第二天，她终于通过询问她的母亲向当局说出了她的第一句话。维多利亚州警方与奥克兰的同行取得了联系，后者表示正在努力联系安恩·莱尔（Anen Leal）。她的手机关机了，于是他们前往该家庭的住所，那是位于西南部埃普索姆郊区基斯顿大道（Keystone Avenue）的一栋白色木板房。

22
00:15:54.000 --> 00:16:36.000
The police found no sign of Annen at the property, nor was her vehicle there, but Shwey's Honda Rafaga sedan was parked out the front. Police also checked Annen's bank accounts and discovered there had been no activity since Monday, September 10, 2007. On Tuesday, September 18, investigators publicly urged Shwey to contact law enforcement. They confirmed they were working to track him down with the International Criminal Police Organization, better known as Interpol, and openly labelled his fleeing with Chen Shun as a kidnapping.
警方在房产处没有发现安恩的踪迹，她的车也不在那里，但施韦的本田拉法加（Rafaga）轿车停在门前。警方还检查了安恩的银行账户，发现自2007年9月10日星期一以来没有任何交易活动。9月18日星期二，调查人员公开敦促施韦联系执法部门。他们确认正在与国际刑警组织（更广为人知的名称是国际刑警组织，Interpol）合作追踪他的下落，并公开将他带着陈顺潜逃的行为定性为绑架。

23
